{"id":"9e0c0a8b7d76229e","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-measure7-exchangeable-sigma-algebra.md","title":"ZFC Measure7 Exchangeable Sigma Algebra","display":"df-zfc-measure7-exchangeable-sigma-algebra — ZFC Measure7 Exchangeable Sigma Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure7-exchangeable-sigma-algebra","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure7-exchangeable-sigma-algebra"],"display":"df-zfc-measure7-exchangeable-sigma-algebra — ZFC Measure7 Exchangeable Sigma Algebra","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[58-df-bijective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure7-exchangeable-sigma-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure7-exchangeable-sigma-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure7-exchangeable-sigma-algebra — ZFC Measure7 Exchangeable Sigma Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective.md\">58-df-bijective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal E\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal E\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (bijection predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective.md\">58-df-bijective.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FinPerm}(\\omega)\\in V\">\\(\\operatorname{FinPerm}(\\omega)\\in V\\)</span> (finite-support permutations, defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7ExchangeableSigmaAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7ExchangeableSigmaAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}finite\\text{-}permutations}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FinPerm}(\\omega)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\pi\\in V:\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi,\\omega,\\omega)\\land\n\\left|\\{n\\in\\omega:\\pi(n)\\neq n\\}\\right|&lt;\\omega\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}finite\\text{-}permutations}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FinPerm}(\\omega)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\pi\\in V:\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi,\\omega,\\omega)\\land\n\\left|\\{n\\in\\omega:\\pi(n)\\neq n\\}\\right|&lt;\\omega\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}exchangeable\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7ExchangeableSigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X^\\omega)\n\\land\\mathcal E=\\left\\{A\\in\\mathcal A:\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\operatorname{FinPerm}(\\omega)\\;\n\\left(\\left\\{y\\in X^\\omega:\\exists x\\in A\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\ny(\\pi(n))=x(n)\\right\\}=A\\right)\\right\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal E,X^\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}exchangeable\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7ExchangeableSigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X^\\omega)\n\\land\\mathcal E=\\left\\{A\\in\\mathcal A:\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\operatorname{FinPerm}(\\omega)\\;\n\\left(\\left\\{y\\in X^\\omega:\\exists x\\in A\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\ny(\\pi(n))=x(n)\\right\\}=A\\right)\\right\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal E,X^\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Finite permutations are set-coded bijections with finite support. Their action is expanded pointwise as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y(\\pi(n))=x(n)\">\\(y(\\pi(n))=x(n)\\)</span>, so no undeclared action, inverse-function, or untyped bijection notation remains.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Bijective}\\subseteq V^3$ (bijection predicate, see [[58-df-bijective.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FinPerm}(\\omega)\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7ExchangeableSigmaAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}finite\\text{-}permutations}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FinPerm}(\\omega)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\pi\\in V:\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi,\\omega,\\omega)\\land\n\\left|\\{n\\in\\omega:\\pi(n)\\neq n\\}\\right|<\\omega\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}exchangeable\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7ExchangeableSigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X^\\omega)\n\\land\\mathcal E=\\left\\{A\\in\\mathcal A:\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\operatorname{FinPerm}(\\omega)\\;\n\\left(\\left\\{y\\in X^\\omega:\\exists x\\in A\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\ny(\\pi(n))=x(n)\\right\\}=A\\right)\\right\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal E,X^\\omega).","display":true},{"tex":"y(\\pi(n))=x(n)","display":false}],"bytes":1817,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2630","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-measure7-exchangeable-sigma-algebra.md|58-df-zfc-measure7-exchangeable-sigma-algebra]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a740bdad87b97ac6","d583890235faf0d5"]}